# Backend base URL comes from the parent shell (`backend.url` → `authBackendBaseUrl` in `SHELLUI_SETTINGS`).
# No env var is required for the identity API origin when the admin runs inside Shellui.
# Storage base URL comes from host `storage.url` → `storage` in SDK settings.
# Email base URL comes from host `email.url` → `email` in SDK settings (default https://email.shellui.com).
# Staff Django admin links use that service origin plus /admin/. No extra env var.
